<section class="section hero-style-3 d-flex flex-column-reverse d-sm-block bg-primary">
	<div class="half-rounded-img right">
		<img src="https://pomcar.com/wp-content/themes/mt-pomcar-1.0.5/img/family-with-kids-happy-in-car.jpg" alt="" class="">	</div>
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 col-sm-7 col-md-6 vh-65 d-flex text-white py-5">
				<div class="inner">
						<h1 class="my-5 fs-xl">Vehicle Inspection Packages</h1>

	<h2 class="fw-semibold mb-5 fs-4">Whether this is your first car or
		<span class="d-none d-lg-block"></span>twentieth, no one wants to be stuck
		<span class="d-none d-lg-block"></span>with a “lemon”.
		<br><br>
		<span class="d-none d-lg-block"></span>Hire a company you can trust to
		<span class="d-none d-lg-block"></span>perform a vehicle inspection before
		<span class="d-none d-lg-block"></span>you buy.</h2>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section get-started">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 pb-0 py-4 py-lg-5">
				<div class="section-inner text-center py-3">
					<h3 class="text-secondary">Get Started</h3>
					<h2 class="text-primary fs-1 mb-5">Vehicle Inspection Packages</h2>
					<p class="w-lg-50 mx-auto mb-5">All POMCAR vehicle inspection packages include a 270-point inspection and road test (provided vehicle is road worthy and seller/dealer allows for one). <br><strong>The best package for you depends on the vehicle to be inspected.</strong></p>

					<div class="package-grid pt-lg-5">
													<div class="package d-flex ">
																<div class="package-inner d-flex flex-column justify-content-between rounded-2 bg-light overflow-hidden">
									<div class="overflow-hidden package-image rounded-2">
										<img src="https://pomcar.com/wp-content/themes/mt-pomcar-1.0.5/img/mechanic/check-inside-480.jpg" alt="Starter" class="" width="720" height="480" loading="lazy">									</div>
									<div class="package-content d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 align-items-center p-4 pb-5 p-lg-5">
										<h3 class="package-title text-primary">Starter</h3>
										<h5 class="package-price text-secondary mb-4">
											$180										</h5>
										<div class="package-details flex-grow-1 mb-4">
											<p><strong>Vehicles 1995 and up. <br>Where no fluid check required.</strong></p>
		<p>Includes our 270-point inspection and up to three focus areas of your choosing.</p>										</div>
										<a href="https://pomcar.com/inspection-request"
											class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg btn-block"><i class="fa-solid fa-car-wrench"></i> ORDER
											NOW</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="package d-flex ">
																<div class="package-inner d-flex flex-column justify-content-between rounded-2 bg-light overflow-hidden">
									<div class="overflow-hidden package-image rounded-2">
										<img src="https://pomcar.com/wp-content/themes/mt-pomcar-1.0.5/img/mechanic/checking-fluid-480.jpg" alt="Experienced" class="" width="720" height="480" loading="lazy">									</div>
									<div class="package-content d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 align-items-center p-4 pb-5 p-lg-5">
										<h3 class="package-title text-primary">Experienced</h3>
										<h5 class="package-price text-secondary mb-4">
											$185										</h5>
										<div class="package-details flex-grow-1 mb-4">
											<p><strong>Vehicles 1995 and older. <br>When no onboard diagnostics scan available.</strong></p>
		<p>Includes Starter Package and a check of all fluid levels. The fluid levels help determine whether a vehicle has been properly maintained and how long it has been sitting idle.</p>										</div>
										<a href="https://pomcar.com/inspection-request"
											class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg btn-block"><i class="fa-solid fa-car-wrench"></i> ORDER
											NOW</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="package d-flex highlight">
																	<div class="package-highlight bg-primary rounded-2">
										<div class="text-white p-2 small">MOST POPULAR</div>
									</div>
																<div class="package-inner d-flex flex-column justify-content-between rounded-2 bg-light overflow-hidden">
									<div class="overflow-hidden package-image rounded-2">
										<img src="https://pomcar.com/wp-content/themes/mt-pomcar-1.0.5/img/mechanic/scan-1-480.jpg" alt="Professional" class="" width="720" height="480" loading="lazy">									</div>
									<div class="package-content d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1 align-items-center p-4 pb-5 p-lg-5">
										<h3 class="package-title text-primary">Professional</h3>
										<h5 class="package-price text-secondary mb-4">
											$195										</h5>
										<div class="package-details flex-grow-1 mb-4">
											<p><strong>Vehicles 1996 and newer. <br>Those equipped with OBD-II systems. Checks for active or stored codes.</strong></p>
		<p>Includes Experienced Package, plus an OBD-II scan of the onboard computer to reveal any active trouble codes that should be addressed immediately.</p>										</div>
										<a href="https://pomcar.com/inspection-request"
											class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg btn-block"><i class="fa-solid fa-car-wrench"></i> ORDER
											NOW</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
											</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<section class="section text-se-border-arrows bg-secondary py-5">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 py-4 py-lg-5">
					<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-column flex-lg-row gap-5 text-white">
		<div>
			<i class="fa-thin fa-bullseye-arrow fa-7x"></i>
		</div>
		<div class="text-center text-lg-start">
			<h3>Determine Your Focus Areas</h3>
			<p class="fs-4 mb-0">Is there something in the vehicle advertisement you want to investigate?<br>
				Did the seller make a comment that you want to confirm or do you just <span class="d-none d-xl-block"></span>need reassurance you are making a solid purchase decision? Let us
				know.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<section class="section 270-points-performed bg-white py-5">
	<div class="white-down-arrow center"></div>
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 pb-md-4 pt-md-5">
				<div class="section-inner">
					<div class="text-center mb-5">
						<h2 class="text-primary fs-1">270-Points Performed</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 g-2">
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Verification</h4>
										<p>To start, vehicle details as advertised are confirmed to include color, VIN, and reported mileage.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-0"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-0">
											15 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-0">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">VIN Check on dash, doors, hood, trunk</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Confirm vehicle as advertised (Year, Make, Model, Trim Engine, Transmission, Exterior Color, Interior Color)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Odometer Reading</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of Owner’s Manual</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Service History Check</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Maintenance Record Check</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of CARFAX Report</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white"># of Ignition Keys</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white"># of FOBs</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white"># of Glove /box Keys</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Tires &amp; Brakes</h4>
										<p>Each tire, including the spare, checked for size, brand, and tread depth. Brake pad wear is also measured for your safety.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-1"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-1">
											52 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-1">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Wiggle Test for excess movement in the steering linkage and ball joints</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Tire Characteristics (Brand, Model, Class, Width, Aspect Ratio, Construction, Diameter, Speed Rating)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of Valve Cap Stem</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence and condition of the wheel cover, hub cap, or center cap</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence and condition of mud flaps and wind deflectors (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the wheel, such as scratches, dents, corrosion, and presence of lugnuts and wheel locks</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Shocks &amp; Struts - bounce test of the shock absorber</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the pads, caliper, and rotor</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Tire Tread Depth (Inboard, Center, Outboard)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Brake Pad Thickness</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Exterior &amp; Undercarriage</h4>
										<p>All panels checked for evidence of dings, dents, and scratches. Underbody inspected for any signs of damage.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-2"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-2">
											94 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-2">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of accessories that would have been installed after purchase, whether aftermarket or factory</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of non-OEM parts, such as non-factory wheels or fog lights and their condition</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">All doors and check straps for damage and proper alignment</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Doors seals, door locks</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Side-view mirrors</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the window glass and belt molding, as well as non-OE tinting</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the door handle, physically and operationally</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of door trim pieces or garnishes</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of door rocker panel</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Roof</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Rack Rails</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Sunroof</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Fender/Liner</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Front Grille</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Front Hood</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Trunk Lid/Tailgate</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Bed Liner &amp; Cover</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Bumper / Spoiler</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Exhaust &amp; Tailgate</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Gas Cap</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">GPS Antenna</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Electrical &amp; Lights</h4>
										<p>Any instrument that relies upon battery power is examined to ensure proper and reliable function.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-3"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-3">
											44 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-3">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Lights – headlights, marker lights, low beams, high beams, fog lights, turn signals, brake lights, hazards</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of all mirrors</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of all windows</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of all window wipers</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of all defoggers</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Instrument Cluster Function</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Horn Function</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Ignition Key Function and Engine Start</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Dashboard Backlighting</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of dome lights, map lights, and vanity lights</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Daytime Running Lamps</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Remote starter operation (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Sunroof/Moonroof operation (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of the HVAC system, including air distribution, heating, cooling, and air conditioning</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">SRS/Airbag System Functionality</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Power socket/cigarette lighter function</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">KOER Light Test</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Interior</h4>
										<p>Cabin appearance evaluated and interior leather, fabric, carpet, vinyl, and plastic trim and surfaces checked for evidence of rips, tears, wear, and fading.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-4"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-4">
											30 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-4">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Seat condition, adjustment operation, heat function (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of odors or stains</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition and operation of seat belts and buckles</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the pedals and pedal covers, including the accelerator, brake, clutch, and parking brake</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of the shift lever, including the knob, bezel, and cover or boot</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Floors and carpets</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Seatbelt Warning</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Engine noise, vibration, or harshness</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Parking brake condition and operation</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Engine</h4>
										<p>Critical components such as belts and hoses are examined. Battery is tested (except for hybrids and electrics) and a voltage reading is obtained.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-5"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-5">
											15 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-5">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Functional Gas Cap</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Verify proper operation of the trunk lid release, via button or lever inside, as well as via key FOB (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of the hood release and the primary and secondary hood latches</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Engine Air Filter Condition</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Accessory Drive Belts</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Condition of any visible wiring harnesses, fuse and relay boxes</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Battery Voltage Reading (at rest and while running)</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Road Test</h4>
										<p>Engine performance, wind noise, alignment, speedometer/odometer function, and braking performance examined.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-6"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-6">
											13 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-6">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Security &amp; Remote check</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Proper engine operation, smooth idle, good acceleration, stable cruising speed</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of transmission</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of the transfer case, locking differentials, or other 4x4 / AWD related controls (if equipped)</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Operation of the cruise control system</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Brake System Function</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Steering Operation</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Noise, Vibrations, Harshness</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Suspension Check</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Cooling Fan Operation post-drive</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Fluid Checks*</h4>
										<p>Oil, brake, clutch, transmission, and power steering fluid levels checked among others.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-7"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-7">
											5 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-7">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Engine Oil</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Transmission Fluid</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Engine Coolant</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Brake &amp; Clutch Fluid</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Washer Fluid</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex">
								<div class="inspection-point d-flex flex-column text-white bg-primary rounded-2">
									<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center flex-grow-1 text-center p-5">
										<h4>Diagnostic Scan*</h4>
										<p>Scan performed to confirm VIN and report error codes if present.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="border-top border-light bg-dark rounded-bottom p-4">
										<div class="text-pink d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center cursor-pointer"
											data-bs-toggle="collapse"
											data-bs-target="#expand-8"
											aria-expanded="false"
											aria-controls="expand-8">
											2 Point Checks											<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-white rotate"></i>
										</div>
										<div class="collapse" id="expand-8">
											<ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3">
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">VIN Confirmation</li>
																									<li class="list-group-item border-light bg-dark text-white">Presence of Diagnostic Trouble Codes (DTCs)</li>
																							</ul>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
											</div>
					<div class="text-center mt-5 mb-0">
						<p>*Additional checks depending on package selection and availability</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section information-needed bg-light py-4">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 d-flex align-items-center py-5">
				<div class="section-inner">
					<div class="text-center">
						<h2 class="h1 text-primary">Information Needed</h2>
						<p class="mb-5">When you’re ready to request your car inspection package, you will need the following:</p>
					</div>
					<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-sm-2 g-2">

													<div class="col d-flex-inline flex-column">
								<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-3 px-3 py-5 h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
									<h5 class="text-secondary mb-4">Vehicle Identification Number (VIN)</h5>
									<p>The 17-character VIN is usually found at the bottom of the front windshield. Be sure to get this information from the seller or when you view the vehicle yourself.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex-inline flex-column">
								<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-3 px-3 py-5 h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
									<h5 class="text-secondary mb-4">Vehicle Address</h5>
									<p>The location the vehicle is determines where an inspection will take place. If POMCAR doesn’t have a technician qualified to inspect your vehicle in your area, we will let you know right away.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex-inline flex-column">
								<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-3 px-3 py-5 h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
									<h5 class="text-secondary mb-4">Seller Phone Number</h5>
									<p>You don’t have to be in the middle. POMCAR will coordinate directly with the seller to schedule the inspection.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="col d-flex-inline flex-column">
								<div class="bg-white shadow rounded-3 px-3 py-5 h-100 d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
									<h5 class="text-secondary mb-4">Your Focus Areas</h5>
									<p>If you have specific concerns about the vehicle, let us know. You can identify up to three focus areas for our technicians to address.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						
					</div>
					<div class="text-center mt-5">
						<h3 class="text-primary">Not sure what package you need?</h3>
						<p class="fs-3">Contact us below and we can discuss options.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
